---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="wrap section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <SectionHeading id="about">About</SectionHeading>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I studied Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning at Anurag University and am now in ASU’s M.S. program in Data
      Science, Analytics and Engineering.
    </p>
    <p>
      I like work where software, data, and models meet, and I try to make results checkable: tests that would catch a
      regression, benchmarks with their conditions stated, and a written list of what a project does not handle yet.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding-top: var(--section-gap);
  }

  .prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    max-width: var(--width-prose);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
</style>
